### Farm API Tests

# 1. Login para obter token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

@token = {{ login.response.body.access_token }}

###

# 2. Obter estado da fazenda
GET http://localhost:3000/farm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# 3. Desbloquear o primeiro plot
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0
}

###

# 4. Plantar trigo
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/plant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0,
  "cropSlug": "wheat_seed"
}

###

# 5. Regar a planta (pode regar imediatamente após plantar)
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/water
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0
}

###

# 6. Verificar estado da fazenda (deve mostrar isWatered: true, waterCount: 1)
GET http://localhost:3000/farm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# 7. Tentar regar novamente (deve falhar porque ainda está úmido)
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/water
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0
}

###

# 8. Aguardar o cooldown de rega (10s para trigo) para poder regar novamente
# Após ficar seco, regar novamente para acumular bônus
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/water
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0
}

###

# 9. Colher (deve mostrar XP bônus se foi regado)
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/harvest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0
}

###

# 10. Plantar milho (crescimento mais longo - 5min) para testar peste
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/plant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0,
  "cropSlug": "corn_seed"
}

###

# 11. Verificar estado da fazenda (recebe willHavePest, pestAppearTime desde o plantio)
GET http://localhost:3000/farm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# 12. Aguardar 50% do tempo (2.5min) e verificar novamente
# Frontend calcula: hasPest = willHavePest && !pestRemoved && agora >= pestAppearTime
GET http://localhost:3000/farm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# 13. Se tiver peste, remover com pesticida
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/spray
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0
}

###

# 14. Tentar remover peste novamente (deve falhar se já foi removida)
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/spray
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0
}

###

# 15. Colher milho (tempo normalizado após remover peste)
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/harvest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0
}
